# OpenAI API Response Fixtures

Store sample API responses here during Phase 0 spike:
- `usage-daily.json` - GET /v1/usage response
- `usage-by-model.json` - GET /v1/usage with group_by=model
- `organization.json` - GET /v1/organization response
- `rate-limit-headers.txt` - Captured X-RateLimit-* headers
